@startuml
title L2-048 - Keep resource use and job recovery bounded
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Backend - Loupe Evaluation / Operations application" #D1FADF
participant "Documented release / restore runner" as page
participant "CapacityProfile" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure and controlled runtime" #FFF4E5
participant "Production stores / workload adapters" as client
end box
note over page : Browser measurements use the production frontend in a controlled harness
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Initial 24 cards; bound preview fetches and decoding [L2-048]
entity -> client : Exercise 20 uploads, lease recovery, extra instances
client --> entity : Memory, job timing, single-publication and quota evidence
entity --> page : Compare to 8 GiB, 5 s start, 10 s visible, 90 s recovery
page --> actor : bounded resource and recovery report
@enduml
